2. Study the "People's Republic of China Cybersecurity Law" and related regulations;
3. Learn to identify and guard against phishing attacks through the official channels of the Ministry of Public Security and the National Internet Emergency Response Center (CNCERT).

Please always abide by the law and maintain a good network environment. If you find any suspicious information, please report it to the public security organs in a timely manner.
